# Development Phases

## Phase 1

Build complete pipeline.

Use only the current 20 Landsat scenes.

Ensure every module works correctly.

- Data loading
- Preprocessing
- Patch generation
- Super Resolution
- Colorization
- Semantic Constraint
- Evaluation
- Streamlit Demo

---

## Phase 2

Increase dataset size.

Simply add more scene folders.

Pipeline should automatically process them.

Do not modify code.

Fine-tune existing models.

---

# Coding Requirements

Build modular code.

Separate

- preprocessing
- training
- inference
- evaluation
- deployment

Each module must be independently executable.

Use configuration files.

Avoid hardcoded paths.

Support CPU and GPU.

Automatically detect dataset folders.

Example

dataset/raw/

↓

Process every scene automatically.

Do NOT assume exactly 20 folders exist.

The pipeline should work for

20 scenes

200 scenes

or

2000 scenes

without code changes.

Save checkpoints after every epoch.

Write reusable functions and classes.

Provide detailed logging.

---

